Package: indianabirdtracker
Title: A Personal Indiana Birding Tracker
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Personal", "Birder", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "birder@example.com")
Description: A small golem-style Shiny application for browsing an Indiana
    bird catalog, recording personal sightings in DuckDB, and reviewing a
    personal birding dashboard.
